// M5-A3P-1010. Ch20 U03 the release: Virel. Wenna asks what they've built since. Liss names the Kite,
// and only now sees (planted in Ch17 B04) that Dace cut its sails to Virel's shape. Wenna lifts LAUGHING. Liss gets her
// people's history back moments before she gives up her machines. The brass tuning key (the keepsake) goes last.
title: ch20_virel_release
location: ch20/undertow_layers
---
@letterbox on
@camera U14
@music silence fade=1.0
Virel as "Wenna" [neutral]: What have you built? Since me. Tell me what you've built. #line:ch20_virel_007
@wait 2.0
Liss [neutral]: A kite. A big one. It flies on a hull. #line:ch20_virel_008
@anim liss look_at virel
@wait 3.0
Liss [surprised]: Its sails. He cut them to your shape. #line:ch20_virel_009
@wait 2.0
Liss [tender]: He flew your kite. We all did. #line:ch20_virel_010
@music release_sting fade=0.0
Virel as "Wenna" [laugh]: Then I flew! #line:ch20_virel_011
@vfx glimmer_lift at=virel count=40 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 6.0
@vfx glimmer_lift at=tuning_key count=1 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 4.0
<<set $ch20_virel_released = true>>
@letterbox off
===
